OL,3,GNEWSADrumcree resolution document not
OL,4,Aacceptable, says DUP MP
OL,5,
OL,6,FA proposed document from the secretary
OL,7,Fof state to resolve the Drumcree
OL,8,Fdispute is "not acceptable", according
OL,9,Fto a Democratic Unionist Party MP.
OL,11,FThe comments from Carla Lockhart came
OL,12,Fas the Garvaghy Road Residents'
OL,13,FCoalition (GRRC) held out the prospect
OL,14,Fof an arrangement to resolve the
OL,15,Fdispute.
OL,23,APub: 30-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
