OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%* ** %-,*,$%** %-& (,,,,,,,
OL,3,GNEWSADrumcree resolution document not
OL,4,Aacceptable, says DUP MP
OL,5,
OL,6,FBreandan Mac Cionnaith emerged from
OL,7,Ftalks at Hillsborough Castle on
OL,8,FWednesday afternoon saying the GRRC
OL,9,F"received a document from the secretary
OL,10,Fof state" but added: "Let's say if it's
OL,11,Faccepted by the Orange Order, it'll be
OL,12,Faccepted by us."
OL,14,FThe Orange Order's Nigel Dawson,
OL,15,Fdistrict master of Portadown, said:
OL,16,F"There are currently no proposals on
OL,17,Fthe table."
